{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, approach it, pick it up, inspect it, and deliver it. Otherwise, search. list of available nodes: <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickObject    /> <SubTree ID = InspectObject    /> <Action ID = DeliverObject    />\"",
